Subject: [PATCH 18/18] nockchain: make prover data cache shareable

Use a no_std spin mutex for the derived ALU schedule cache inside CircuitProverData. Nockchain stores verifier and prover setup behind Arcs that must remain Send + Sync across miner and setup lifecycles; RefCell made the refreshed fork's otherwise immutable setup non-Sync.\n\nVerified:\n- cargo check --manifest-path target/plonky3-recursion-fork/Cargo.toml -p p3-circuit-prover

diff --git a/Cargo.toml b/Cargo.toml
index b6cd09e82b8fdfcc45e743612594b26b626f7f97..7cf38785f69fce925d576bda45f63b329c4244ad 100644
--- a/Cargo.toml
+++ b/Cargo.toml
@@ -83,6 +83,7 @@ itertools = { version = "0.15.0", default-features = false, features = ["use_all
